 <h3><u>Aa gaye panjetan aagaye</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ya Mohammad ya Ali..(2)<br> Fatima, Hasan, Husain..(2)</p> 
  <p>aagae panjetan aagae..(4)</p> 
  <p>jab bicha ghar me farshe aza<br> aagae panjetan aagae..(2)<br> rashk e jannat hua ghar mera<br> aagae panjetan aagae..(4)</p> 
  <p>1. Kaun sajdo ki zeenat banata tujhe<br> kaun jannat ki jannat banata tujhe..(2)<br> ae zamee kar ada shukriya</p> 
  <p>aagae panjetan aagae..(4)</p> 
  <p>2. Ek uljhan thi pehchanu kese use<br> kisko dekhu ke khaliq samajh aa sake..(2)<br> ho gaya hal mera mas'ala</p> 
  <p>aagae panjetan aagae..(4)</p> 
  <p>3. Maut par fatha jab paa gai zindagi<br> uth ke tazeem salma ki mayyat ne ki..(2)<br> gul madaen me hone laga</p> 
  <p>aagae panjetan aagae..(4)</p> 
  <p>4. Dhoom niklega sachaiyo ka abhi<br> haar manegi qaum e nasara abhi..(2)<br> pal me hojaega faisla</p> 
  <p>aagae panjetan aagae..(4)</p> 
  <p>5. Pehle hi usko jaldi shahadat ki thi<br> aakhri saans aur tez chalne lagi..(2)<br> jab ye maqtal me hurr ne suna</p> 
  <p>aagae panjetan aagae..(4)</p> 
  <p>6. Misle nehje balagha jo nukte sune<br> lehja e murtaza me jo khutbe sune..(2)<br> binte zehra ko dene dua</p> 
  <p>aagae panjetan aagae..(4)</p> 
  <p>7. Roze mehshar ke munsib hai aale abaa<br> faisle inko karne hai meri jagah..(2)<br> hashr me khud kahega khuda</p> 
  <p>aagae panjetan aagae..(4)</p> 
  <p>8. Akbar o qasim o zainab o bawafa<br> saath sarwar ke pohcha jo ye qafela..(2)<br> barmala keh uthi karbala</p> 
  <p>aagae panjetan aagae..(4)</p> 
  <p>9. Meri nisbat hai ae laal tatheer se<br> boli aayat ke jaldi se le chal mujhe..(2)<br> dekh jibreel zere kisa</p> 
  <p>aagae panjetan aagae..(4)</p> 
  <p>10. Pehle hi usko jaldi shahadat ki thi<br> aakhri saans aur tez chalne lagi..(2)<br> jab ye maqtal me hurr ne suna</p> 
  <p>aagae panjetan aagae..(4)</p> 
  <p>11. Unke darr se wafa ka sila mil gaya<br> jab bhi likha takallum qaseeda naya..(2)<br> khud badhane mera hausla</p> 
  <p>aagae panjetan aagae..(4)</p> 
  <p>Ya Mohammad ya Ali..(2)<br> Fatima, Hasan, Husain..(2)</p> 
